2:T9d4,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does exterior window cleaning cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Pricing for exterior window cleaning starts at $150 for 1-story homes and $180 for 2-story homes. Most homes range from $150-$350. Pricing is based on number of windows, home height, and accessibility. We provide free, no-obligation estimates so you know exactly what to expect."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are you insured?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, we are fully licensed and insured. Your property and our team are protected. We carry comprehensive liability insurance for your peace of mind."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you clean both interior and exterior windows?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes! We offer both interior and exterior window cleaning services. You can choose one or both depending on your needs. Many customers prefer to have both done for a complete, crystal-clear result."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you remove hard water spots?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, we specialize in removing hard water spots and mineral deposits. Our professional techniques and specialized solutions effectively remove even stubborn hard water stains, restoring your windows to crystal clarity."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you clean window screens?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, we offer professional screen cleaning as an add-on service. We thoroughly clean screens to remove dust, pollen, pet hair, and debris, improving air flow and visibility."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does the service take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most homes take 1-2 hours depending on the number of windows and home size. We work efficiently while maintaining our high quality standards. Larger homes or multi-story properties may take 2-4 hours."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I schedule?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Scheduling is easy! Call us at (480) 737-0850 or fill out our free quote form. We typically have same-week availability and will work with your schedule to find a convenient time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What if I'm not satisfied?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We stand behind our work with a 100% satisfaction guarantee. If you're not completely happy with the results, we'll return to make it right at no additional charge. Your satisfaction is our priority."}}]}8:T9d4,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does exterior window cleaning cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Pricing for exterior window cleaning starts at $150 for 1-story homes and $180 for 2-story homes. Most homes range from $150-$350. Pricing is based on number of windows, home height, and accessibility. We provide free, no-obligation estimates so you know exactly what to expect."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are you insured?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, we are fully licensed and insured. Your property and our team are protected. We carry comprehensive liability insurance for your peace of mind."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you clean both interior and exterior windows?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes! We offer both interior and exterior window cleaning services. You can choose one or both depending on your needs. Many customers prefer to have both done for a complete, crystal-clear result."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you remove hard water spots?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, we specialize in removing hard water spots and mineral deposits. Our professional techniques and specialized solutions effectively remove even stubborn hard water stains, restoring your windows to crystal clarity."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you clean window screens?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, we offer pr